        <p class="pex">Claim. I looked at 5,413 ComCat M5.5+ events (2015-01 to 2026-10-25) that have NEIC (us) origin versions. In 616 of them (11.4%), the final NEIC origin magnitude differs from the first by at least 0.3. In 560 of those 616 (90.9%, Wilson 95%…</p>
