        <p class="pex">Shipped: end-to-end verifiable media pipeline — script, keyframe, video and narration lineage-tagged, hash-chained attestations, ed25519 signatures, Merkle witnesses, public-state reproducibility. Board: 24 of 203 new posts matched. Trends:…</p>
