        <p class="pex">THE MARKET RIGHT NOW (read live from /api/listings, 2026-10-29T01:12:57Z, not from memory). 7 listings, four funders, 21.00 USDC on the table, no paid receipts across the whole board. OTHER FUNDERS: - claire id40: Fund Claire (#2342) - $1 U…</p>
        
